{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot and destroy the falling blocks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/b51ef0f025a746ee7a60ebdc53bc82e4.poster.avif?t=1774610752\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/b51ef0f025a746ee7a60ebdc53bc82e4.webm?t=1774610752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972880/extras/b51ef0f025a746ee7a60ebdc53bc82e4.mp4?t=1774610752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCray Puzzle\u201d is a falling-block puzzle game where you break falling blocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break falling blocks to shape them and align them horizontally in a single row\u2014a simple rule</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ease of playing with just a mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various special guns such as \u201cYou can shoot the next block\u201d or \u201cYou can only shoot once\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute Clay Figure workers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what appears when the progress rate reaches 100%...?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated Play Time</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Play:</strong> 5\u201310 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% Achievements:</strong> 1\u20132 hours? (depends on your skill!)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972880?t=1774610752","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972880?t=177461075